{
  "uid": "fraud-monitoring",
  "title": "Fraud scoring - live monitoring",
  "description": "Hourly summaries written by the Flink scoring job. PaySim has no calendar: step s is shown as 2024-01-01 00:00 UTC plus s hours.",
  "tags": [
    "fraud",
    "flink",
    "mlflow"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "time": {
    "from": "2024-01-16T18:00:00Z",
    "to": "2024-01-18T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Transactions scored",
      "description": "In-scope transactions scored in the selected hours.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and r._field == \"scored\")\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alerts raised",
      "description": "Transactions at or above the champion's alert threshold.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and r._field == \"alerts\")\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fraud caught by alerts",
      "description": "Alerted transactions later labelled fraud.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and r._field == \"fraud_alerted\")\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dead letters (last 30 days)",
      "description": "Malformed messages routed to the dead-letter topic (each message there records its reason). Counted in processing time, so the range is the last 30 days rather than the dashboard range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: -30d)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"dead_letters\" and r._field == \"count\")\n  |> group()\n  |> sum()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transactions scored per hour",
      "description": "Volume follows PaySim's daily cycle.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and (r._field == \"scored\"))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_field\", \"_value\"])"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alerts and fraud caught per hour",
      "description": "Alerts at the threshold set for a 0.5% alert budget on validation data.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and (r._field == \"alerts\" or r._field == \"fraud_alerted\"))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_field\", \"_value\"])"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alert precision and recall per hour",
      "description": "Uses fraud labels, which in production arrive later than the score.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and (r._field == \"alert_precision\" or r._field == \"recall\"))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_field\", \"_value\"])"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Score drift: PSI against the validation scores",
      "description": "Population stability index of each hour's scores against the validation distribution. Rule of thumb: under 0.1 stable, 0.1-0.25 moderate, over 0.25 large. Part of the hourly variation is the daily cycle itself, since validation spans whole days. In the overnight hours (03:00-08:00) only 10-28 transfers and cash-outs occur and almost all are fraud, so every score falls in the top reference bin and PSI saturates near 8.3: a real shift, but from too few transactions to act on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"fraud-monitoring\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"hourly\" and (r._field == \"psi\"))\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\", \"_field\", \"_value\"])"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
